  <para style="h">1 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya mbere ryanditswe na Petero</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya mbere ryanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petero</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Jewe Petero, intumwa ya Yesu Kristo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1PE 1:1">Ndabandikiye mwebwe abatoranijwe n’Imana mwashwiragiriye i Ponto, i Galatiya, i Kapadokiya, muri Aziya n’i Bituniya. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Imana Data yabamenye kuva kera irabatoranya, Mpwemu wayo arabeza kugira ngo mwumvire Yesu Kristo mwogejwe n’amaraso yiwe:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1PE 1:2">Ubuntu n’amahoro bibe muri mwebwe bisesekaye.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana ishimirwe ivyizigiro bizima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Amashimwe yose abe ay’Imana Se w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, kuko ku bw’imbabazi zayo nyinshi, yaduhaye kuvuka ubwa kabiri, mu kuzura Yesu Kristo mu bapfuye. Ubu dufise ivyizigiro bizima <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />vyo kuzoronka umugabane udashobora guhera, kwononekara canke gusaza. Uwo mugabane uzigamiwe mw’ijuru ku bwanyu. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Kandi biciye muri ukwo kwizera, murakingiwe n’ubushobozi bw’Imana, kugeza mushikiriye ako gakiza kateguwe kuzohishurwa mu gihe c’iherezo. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ni co gituma mukwiye kunezerwa, kuko naho ubu mutegerezwa kwihanganira imibabaro y’uburyo bwinshi ariko y’akanya gato, mu nyuma hari umunezero mwinshi. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Iyo mibabaro iriho kugira ngo ipime ukwizera kwanyu yerekane ko ari ukw’ukuri. Kurya inzahabu ishira igeragereshwa umuriro kugira ngo igaragare ko ari iy’ukuri, ni ko biri no ku kwizera kwanyu. Gufise agaciro kanini cane kurusha ak’inzahabu, ni co gituma gupimwa kugira ngo nikwamara kurama, kuze kubazanire ubwiza, gushimwa n’icubahiro ku musi Yesu Kristo azohishurirwa isi yose. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Uwo Yesu muramukunda naho mutigeze mumubona, kandi muramwizera naho mutamubona. Ni co gituma mwuzuye umunezero amajambo adashobora gusobanura, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />kuko ku bw’ukwizera kwanyu, muzoronka agakiza k’ubugingo bwanyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Ivy’ako gakiza, abavugishwa n’Imana ba kera, ari bo bavugishijwe ivyerekeye ubwo buntu mwagira muhabwe, baragerageje kubirondera no kubimenya. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Mpwemu wa Kristo yari muri bo yaguma avuga ivyerekeye imibabaro ya Kristo n’ubwiza buzoyiherukira bitaraba; na bo bagashaka kumenya igihe ivyo bizoshikira n’uko bizogenda. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Imana yabahishuriye ko ivyo bavugishwa bitari biberekeye, ahubwo ko vyari vyerekeye mwebwe. Ubwo butumwa namwe mwarabubwiwe n’ababuvuga basunitswe na Mpwemu Yera yarungitswe avuye mw’ijuru. Ivyo ni igitangaza kuko n’abamarayika baripfuza kubibona bishika.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mube abera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Nuko rero mwame mugavye kandi mwirinde. Ivyizigiro vyanyu vyose mubishire ku buntu muzohabwa igihe Yesu Kristo azohishurirwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Mubeho mwumvira Imana nk’abana bagamburuka. Ntimugasubire kubaho muhaza ivyipfuzo bibi vyabaganza mu gihe mwari mu butamenya. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ahubwo, nk’uko Imana yabahamagaye ari iyera, namwe mube abera mu ngeso zanyu zose, <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />kuko n’Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: “Mube abera nk’uko nanje ndi uwera.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Abalewi 11:44</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 11:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Mwibuke ko Data wo mw’ijuru, uwo musenga, adaca urwa nkunzi, hanyuma bitume mubaho muyitinya kandi muyubaha mu gihe musigaje kuba kuri ino si mubako nk’ingenzi. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Murazi ko mwacunguwe mukava mu buzima butagira ikimazi, ubwo mwarazwe na ba sogokuruza. Iyo ncungu si ibintu bishira nk’ifeza canke inzahabu, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ahubwo ni amaraso y’igiciro kinini ya Kristo, Umwagazi w’intama w’Imana utagira icaha canke umugayo. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Imana yari yaramutoranije imbere y’uko isi iremwa, ariko yamuhishuye ubu muri ino misi ya nyuma ku bwanyu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Biciye muri Kristo, mwahawe kwizera Imana. Kandi ukwizera kwanyu n’ivyizigiro vyanyu mwabishize mu Mana kuko yamuzuye imukuye mu bapfuye, ikamuha ubwiza.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Ubu rero ko mwiyejeje mu kwumvira ukuri, bigatuma mugiriranira urukundo ruva ku mutima vy’ukuri, nimukundane cane nk’abavukana kandi n’imitima yanyu yose. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ubu mwaravutse ubwa kabiri, ntimwavukiye ubuzima bw’akanya gato. Ubuzima bwanyu bushasha ni ubw’ibihe bidashira kuko buva ku mbuto itabora, ari ryo jambo rizima ry’Imana rihoraho. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Abantu bose bameze nk’ivyatsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">kandi ubwiza bwabo bwose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">bumeze nk’amashurwe yo ku misozi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">ivyatsi biruma, amashurwe agahungurukira hasi,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ariko ijambo ry’Uhoraho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:25">ryo rihoraho ibihe vyose.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Yesaya 40:6-8</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Kandi iryo jambo ni bwo Butumwa Bwiza mwabwiwe.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Mwiyambure rero ingeso mbi zose. Muve mu bubeshi, uburyarya, ishari, hamwe n’amajambo mabi yose. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Mumere nk’abana bato b’inzoya, mwipfuze kandi murondere kunywa amata y’impwemu atavanze, kugira ngo abakuze mu gakiza, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />nimba vy’ukuri mumaze kwumviriza mukamenya ukugira neza kw’Umwami wacu.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amabuye afise ubugingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Nimwegere Umwami, ni we buye rifise ubugingo ryagawe n’abantu ariko ryatoranijwe n’Imana. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Kandi namwe muri amabuye afise ubugingo Imana iriko irubakisha urusengero rwayo rw’impwemu, kugira ngo mube abaherezi bayo bera, batanga ibimazi vy’impwemu biyihimbara, biciye muri Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Raba ndashira ibuye i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ibuye rigumya imfuruka, ryatoranijwe kandi ry’igiciro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">uwumwizera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ntazokwigera amaramara.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Yesaya 28:16</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kuri mwebwe abizera, iryo buye rifise igiciro kinini; ni ryo ryahindutse irigumya imfuruka. Ariko ku batizera bo, handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Ibuye abubatsi bagaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ni ryo ryahindutse irigumya imfuruka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zaburi 118:22</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Kandi ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Ni ibuye ritsitaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">n’urutare rugwisha.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Yesaya 8:14</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Batsitara kuko batumvira ubutumwa bari barateguriwe.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ariko mweho muri ubwoko bwatoranijwe, abaherezi b’Umwami, ihanga ryejejwe Imana yiharije, kugira ngo mukwize ishimwe ryayo, yo yabahamagaye ikabakura mu mwijima, ikabazana mu muco wayo utangaje. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Kera ntimwari ubwoko, ariko ubu muri ubwoko bw’Imana, kera ntimwari bwagirirwe imbabazi, ariko ubu mwarazigiriwe.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwirinda ivyipfuzo vy’umubiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Bakundwa, ndabahanura, ko muri abashitsi n’ingenzi mw’isi, mwirinde ivyipfuzo vy’umubiri vyama bigwanya ubugingo bwanyu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Mugire inyifato nziza mu bo mubana batizera, kugira ngo n’aho babavuga nabi nk’inkozi z’ibibi, baze babone ingeso zanyu nziza, bitume bahimbaza Imana umusi izobagendera.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ku bw’Umwami wacu, mwubahe ababaganza: umukuru w’igihugu kuko ari we ari hejuru ya bose, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />canke abatware yahaye kumutwarira intara kugira ngo bahane abakora ibibi kandi bashimire abakora ivyiza. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Kuko ico Imana igomba ni uko mukora ivyiza, bigatuma abatubaha Imana babura ico babavuga. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Mubeho mu mwidegemvyo, ariko uwo mwidegemvyo wanyu ntube uwo guhisha ububi; ahubwo mubeho nk’abeguriwe Imana. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mwubahe umuntu wese, mukunde bene Data, mutinye Imana, mwubahe umwami.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Namwe bagurano, mwumvire ba shobuja mububaha rwose, mukore ivyo bababwiye mutabikorera abameze neza gusa, ariko na barya bagoye. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Kuko Imana inezerezwa no kubona mukora ibigororotse kandi mwihanganira imibabaro iyo murenganywa muzira kuyubaha. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kuko nimba mwihanganiye guhanwa muhorwa gucumura, n’irihe teka ivyo vyobatera? Ariko nimba mubabazwa muhorwa kuba mwakoze ivyiza hanyuma mukihanganira iyo mibabaro, Imana irabanezererwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Kuko, Imana yabahamagariye gukora ivyiza, mbere no mu gihe ivyo bishobora kubashikana mu mibabaro, nk’uko Kristo na we yababajwe ku bwanyu. Ni we citegererezo canyu kandi mutegerezwa kumwigana.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />“Ntiyigeze acumura na rimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">kandi ntiyigeze abesha umuntu n’umwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Yesaya 53:9</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Abamututse ntiyabihora, canke ngo ahige kwihora abamuteje imibabaro. Ivyo yabirekeye Imana yoyo ica imanza ziroranye. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Ku musaraba, Kristo ubwiwe yishizeko ivyaha vyacu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Yesaya 53:5</ref></char></char></note> kugira ngo kamere muntu kacu ko gukunda icaha gapfe, tubeho dukunda gukora ivyo kugororoka. Mu bikomere vyiwe ni ho dukura gukira ingwara. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Kera mwari mumeze nk’intama zazimiye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Yesaya 53:6</ref></char></char></note> ariko ubu mwaragarutse ku mwungere w’ubugingo bwanyu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abagore n’abagabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Kandi muri iyo nzira nyene, bagore, mwubahe abagabo banyu; kugira ngo na barya batumvira Ubutumwa Bwiza, bahindurwe n’ingeso nziza z’abagore babo ata majambo arinze kuvugwa, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />babonye ubugwaneza no kububaha bigaragara mu buzima bwanyu. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Ntimwiteho cane ubwiza bw’inyuma ku mubiri buhagaze ku buryo kanaka bugezweho bwo gusokoza umushatsi, kwambara ibintu vyo kubashariza bikozwe mu nzahabu, canke impuzu z’igiciro kinini. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ariko mwambare ubwiza buva imbere muri mwebwe, budatituka ari bwo kugira umutima mwiza kandi utuje. Ubwo ni bwo bwiza bufise igiciro kinini imbere y’Imana. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ni muri ubwo buryo abagore bera ba kera bashaza. Bashize ivyizigiro vyabo mu Mana hanyuma bubaha abagabo babo. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Akarorero ni Sara, yumvira umugabo wiwe, Aburahamu, akamwita umwami wiwe. Namwe muba mubaye abakobwa b’uwo igihe mukoze ibibereye mudatinya.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Muri iyo ntumbero nyene, bagabo, mufate neza abagore banyu mu kubana na bo. Mububahe nk’abazoraganwa namwe ingabire y’ubugingo yatanzwe ku buntu, naho batanganya inkomezi namwe. Mubitwararike kugira ngo ntihagire ikizibira amasengesho yanyu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubabazwa uzira gukora ivyiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Mu kurangiza, mwese nimuhuze umutima n’inama, mubabarane, mukundane nk’abavukana. Mugire umutima mwiza kandi umuntu wese yicishe bugufi imbere ya mugenziwe. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Ntimukihorane canke ngo mwishure uwubatutse. Ahubwo mubahezagire kuko ico ari co Imana yabahamagariye gukora ngo namwe muragwe umuhezagiro. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Kuko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Umuntu wese ashaka ubugingo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">no kubona imisi myiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">narinde ururimi rwiwe kuvuga ikibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">n’iminwa yiwe kuvuga ibinyoma.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Yitandukanye n’ikibi akore ivyiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">arondere amahoro kandi ayakurikirane.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Kuko inyonga z’Uhoraho ziri ku bagororotsi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">kandi amatwi yiwe ayabangira ugusenga kwabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Ariko igitsure ciwe kiri ku bakora ibibi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Zaburi 34:12-16</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />None ni nde azobagirira nabi mu gihe mufise ishaka ryo gukora ivyiza? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ariko naho mwobabazwa muhorwa gukora ivyiza, Imana izobibahezagirira. “Ntimugatinye abantu kandi ntimugahagarike imitima yanyu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">Yesaya 8:12</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ahubwo mu mitima yanyu mwubahe Kristo nk’Umwami. Kandi igihe cose mwame mwiteguye kwishurana ubugwaneza no kwubaha umuntu wese ababajije ivyerekeye ivyizigiro vyanyu. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Mubikorane umutima utabagiriza ikibi, kugira ngo n’ababavuga nabi bazomaramare babonye ingeso zanyu nziza muri Kristo. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Mwibuke ko ari vyiza kubabazwa uhorwa gukora ivyiza nimba ari vyo Imana ishaka kurusha kubabazwa uhorwa gukora ibibi! <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kuko na Kristo yababarijwe ivyaha vyacu rimwe gusa, uwutagira icaha apfira abanyavyaha, kugira ngo abahuze n’Imana. Mu mubiri yarishwe, ariko Mpwemu Yera amusubiza ubugingo. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Kandi ari muri Mpwemu yagiye kubwira Ubutumwa Bwiza impwemu zari mw’ibohero, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />z’abantu banse kwumvira Ubutumwa Bwiza, igihe Imana yari icihanganiye abantu, aho Nowa yubaka ubwato. Abantu umunani gusa bari muri bwo ni bo barokotse bakira umwuzure. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Kandi uwo mwuzure ni ishusho y’umubatizo, ubakiza namwe uno musi. Si mu buryo bwo kubakurako imvyiro zo ku mubiri, ahubwo ni mu buryo bwo kwitaba umuhamagaro w’Imana n’umutima ukeye. Ivyo bishoboka kuko Yesu Kristo yazutse mu bapfuye. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ubu rero Yesu yarasubiye mw’ijuru. Yicaye mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bw’Imana kandi abamarayika, abanyabushobozi n’abanyabubasha bose bari musi y’ubushobozi bwiwe.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ubuzima bwiyeguriye Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Nuko rero, ko Kristo yababajwe mu mubiri, namwe mwamane uwo mutima, igihe cose mwame mwiteguriye kubabazwa nk’uko yababajwe. Kuko uwumaze kubabazwa mu mubiri ahorwa Kristo aba atakiganzwa n’icaha. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Kandi uhereye ico gihe, imisi yose asigaje kubaho, ntaba akirongorwa n’ivyipfuzo vy’umubiri, ariko abaho arongorwa n’ivyo Imana igomba. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Muri kahise mwamaze umwanya munini mukora ivyo abapagani bakunda gukora: ubusambanyi, kwipfuza, kuborerwa, ivy’isoni nke no gusenga ibigirwamana. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ni co gituma, abo mwabikorana kera, batangara babonye mutagifatanije na bo muri vyo, bigatuma babavuga nabi. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ariko mwibuke ko bazorenguka imbere y’intebe y’imanza y’Imana kugira ngo babazwe ivyo bakoze vyose, igihe izocira urubanza abantu bose, abazoba bakiriho n’abazoba barapfuye. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ni co gituma Ubutumwa Bwiza bwabwiwe mbere n’abari barapfuye kugira ngo n’aho bamaze gucirwa urubanza mu mubiri nk’uko biba ku bantu bose, baze babeho mu mpwemu nk’uko Imana iri.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Umuhero wa vyose uri hafi. Ku bw’ivyo, mukwiye kubaho mwirinda kandi mugavye kugira ngo mushobore gusenga. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Ariko ikiruta vyose, mushishikare gukundana, kuko urukundo rupfuka ivyaha vyinshi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mwakirane mu rukundo ata kwidodomba. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Umwe wese akoresha ingabire yose yahawe n’Imana ku nyungu z’abandi. Muzikoreshe nk’abizigirwa b’Imana bagabura ubuntu bw’Imana bw’uburyo bwinshi. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Woba wahawe ingabire yo kuvuga? Uvuge nk’aho Imana ari yo iriko ivugira muri wewe. Woba wahawe ingabire yo gufasha abandi, bikorane inkomezi zose Imana itanga. Ivyo bizotuma muri vyose Imana ihabwa icubahiro mw’izina rya Yesu Kristo. Icubahiro cose n’ubushobozi bibe ivy’Imana ubu n’ibihe bidashira! Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubabazwa kubera uri Umukristo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Bakundwa, ntimutangazwe n’uko muri mu muriro wo kubagerageza, nk’aho womenga mushikiwe n’ikintu kidasanzwe. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ahubwo, mushimire Imana kuko muhawe gusangira na Kristo imibabaro yababajwe, kuko muzogira umunezero wuzuye niyahishurwa mu bwiza bwiwe. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Nibabatuka babahora izina rya Kristo, muze munezerwe kuko Mpwemu w’ubwiza ari we Mpwemu w’Imana ari kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ntihakagire n’umwe muri mwebwe ababazwa ahorwa kuba umwicanyi, umusuma, guteza imigumuko, canke kwita mu vyo atajejwe. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ariko nihagira uwubabazwa ahorwa kuba Umukristo, ntibikamutere isoni. Ahubwo ahimbaze Imana kubera iteka atewe ryo kwitirirwa iryo zina! <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Kuko igihe cashitse c’uko urubanza ruhera mu nzu y’Imana. Nimba urubanza ruhereye kuri twebwe, mbega ntazoba ari akaga gakomeye ku bantu banse kwumvira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana! <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Kandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Nimba umugororotsi arokoka bigoranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">mbega uwutubaha Imana n’umunyavyaha bo bizobagendera gute?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Imigani 11:31</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Nuko rero abababazwa bazira gukora ivyo Imana igomba, bashishikare kubikora, kandi babitse ubugingo bwabo Imana yabaremye, kuko ari iyo kwizigirwa.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ku barongozi mw’ishengero n’abizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Abarongozi b’ishengero bari muri mwebwe ndabinginga nk’umwe mu bo basangiye igikorwa, nkaba n’icabona c’imibabaro ya Kristo kandi nkaba niteze kuzosangira na we ubwiza buzohishurwa: <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />mube abungere b’ubusho Imana yabajeje, muburagire ata gahato, ariko mufise umutima ubikunze, nk’uko Imana ishaka ko mubikora; mutarondera inyungu mbi, ariko nk’abakorera Imana nyene. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Ntimutwaze umukazo abo bantu mwahawe kurongora, ariko mubere akarorero ubwo busho. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Kandi aho Umwungere Mukuru azoserukira, muzohabwa urugori rw’ubwiza rutazokwigera rutakaza ubwiza.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Rwaruka, namwe mwubahe uburongozi bw’ishengero. Kandi umwe wese muri mwebwe yicishe bugufi imbere ya mugenziwe kuko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">“Imana igwanya abibona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">ariko igirira ubuntu abicisha bugufi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Imigani 3:34</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Nuko rero mwicishe bugufi, musi y’ikiganza c’Imana c’ubushobozi kugira ngo ize ibashire hejuru mu gihe gikwiye. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Muyikorere ingorane zanyu zose kuko irabitayeho.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Mwame mugavye. Wa mwansi wanyu, ari we Satani, azunguruka hirya no hino aroha nk’intambwe, arondera uwo yorotsa. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Mumugwanye mushikamye mu kwizera, kuko muzi yuko bene So benshi bariko baraca mu mibabaro nk’iyo mw’isi yose.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Kandi Imana nyene ubuntu, yabahamagariye ubwiza bwayo muri Yesu Kristo, mumaze kubabazwa igihe gito, izobiyegereza ibakomeze, ibaremeshe. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Ubushobozi ni ubwayo ibihe bidashira. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Iri kete rigufi ndaryanditse mfashijwe na Silasi, uwo mfata nka mwene Data w’umwizigirwa, kugira ngo ndabatere intege kandi ndabamenyeshe ko ivyo muriko muracamwo ari ubuntu bw’Imana bw’ukuri. Nuko muhagarare mushikamye muri ubwo buntu.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Ishengero riri i Babiloni ryatoranijwe co kimwe namwe rirabaramutsa, n’umwana wanje Mariko na we arabaramutsa.<verse eid="1PE 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Muramukanishe indamukanyo y’urukundo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 5:14" />
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Amahoro abe kuri mwebwe mwese abari muri Kristo!<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>